 <div class="reason"><b>03 · SHO‘XLIGING</b><p>Chunki sen bilan zerikish qiyin.</p></div>
 <div class="reason"><b>04 · NIGOHING</b><p>Chunki nigohingda o‘zingga xos iliqlik bor.</p></div>
 <div class="reason"><b>05 · OVOZING</b><p>Chunki oddiy gaplaring ham yoqimli eshitiladi.</p></div>
 <div class="reason"><b>06 · MEHRING</b><p>Chunki mehringni qadrlayman.</p></div>
 <div class="reason"><b>07 · O‘ZINGLIGING</b><p>Chunki hech kimga o‘xshashing shart emas.</p></div>
 <div class="reason"><b>08 · XOTIRALAR</b><p>Chunki sen bilan o‘tgan lahzalar yodimda qoladi.</p></div>
 <div class="reason"><b>09 · KICHIK DETALLAR</b><p>Chunki mayda odatlaring ham menga yoqadi.</p></div>
 <div class="reason"><b>10 · ORZULARING</b><p>Chunki orzularing amalga oshishini istayman.</p></div>
 <div class="reason"><b>11 · BARCHINOY</b><p>Chunki bu ro‘yxatdagi eng muhim sabab — bu sensan.</p></div>
 </div>
